    "complexity": "Complex",
    "description": "Malevolent spirits led by a ghostly image of Ludika rise and begin a deadly brawl. These spirits attempt to overwhelm living creatures, forcing them to join the battle.  \n  \nThis haunt is Neutral Evil.",
    "disable": "Religion DC 35 (master) three times to exorcise the spirits or Diplomacy DC 39 (expert) three times to talk them down.",
